# Optional API base URL, inlined at build time. Leave unset for `npm run dev`
# (the app uses http://localhost:3000). An http: or https: value overrides that
# default and the production-host fallback. Any other value is ignored. See
# README.md for precedence. Do not point this
# at production for local or preview builds.
# VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:3000
